  "item_notes": "Owner handoff 2026-10-06 (area-01-wearable-layers-v3): nine wearables, item pixels only, drawn on the relaxed suit at 0,0 (512x1024 at 8x, binary alpha, authored palettes). Draw order body \u2192 legs \u2192 feet \u2192 top (hoodie/tee/vest are alternative tops in the body slot) \u2192 waist \u2192 hand \u2192 head \u2192 face. A head item hides the hair (cap fitted to the bald head). Layers follow the rig row remap; the male arm raise/flex moves the arm under a fixed wrap for the second it lasts. Doc 32: `recolor` maps authored colours to new ones at load, so a layer serves many items (the starter outfit is three recolours of the owner's layers). The canonical body is the bodysuit; the hoodie kit is legacy."
